# Salary Dataset - Linear Regression

## About
This project predicts salary based on years of
experience using Linear Regression. Part of the
Linear Regression practice assignment from the
Full Stack AI Course at Nexskill.

## Dataset
- Source: Kaggle
- Size: 30 samples, 2 columns
- Features: Years of Experience
- Target: Salary

## Steps Performed
- Data loading and exploration
- Checking missing values
- Data visualization (scatter plot, heatmap)
- Train/Test split (80/20)
- Linear Regression model training
- Model evaluation (MAE, RMSE)
- Actual vs Predicted comparison

## Key Insight
Strong positive correlation between years of
experience and salary - as experience increases,
salary increases linearly.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Seaborn
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn
